Files containing material adapted from ForgeFlow (each carries an inline
attribution header):

  * agents/quote_parser/prompts.py      - verbatim-or-null grounding rules,
                                          quote extraction field set
  * agents/quote_parser/schemas.py      - structured quote schema shape
  * agents/quote_parser/classify.py     - inbound-message classification taxonomy
  * agents/quote_parser/completeness.py - missing-field rule set
  * agents/followup/policy.py           - three-way follow-up decision ordering
  * agents/followup/prompts.py          - supplier-facing follow-up writing rules
  * comparison/score.py                 - long-lead-time risk flagging

ForgeFlow itself is NOT vendored into this repository. It remains a separate
reference repository; only the files listed above adapt its design, and all of
them are independent re-implementations against this project's own data model.

