BASE CODEBASE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The application in this repository is built on top of "rfq-comparison-tool"
(FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL backend, React 19 + Vite + Tailwind frontend).
That codebase ships no LICENSE file and is treated as first-party code supplied
by the project owner.

